<a class="portal-skip" href="#story">跳到产品介绍</a>
<header class="portal-header">
  <a href="/" class="portal-brand" aria-label="特友会首页">
    <span class="portal-mark" aria-hidden="true">t<span>+</span></span><strong>特友会</strong><span class="portal-beta">内测中</span>
  </a>
  <nav aria-label="门户导航">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="portal-header-theme"
      data-theme-toggle
      aria-label="切换门户深浅模式"
      aria-pressed="false"
    >
      <i class="mdi mdi-white-balance-sunny" data-theme-icon aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <a href="/sign_in">登录</a>
    <a href={if @registration_policy.allow_registration, do: "/register", else: "#join"}>注册</a>
    <a href="/dashboard" class="portal-console">控制台 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main
  id="story"
  class="portal-story"
  tabindex="0"
  aria-label="特友会产品介绍，可上下滚动切换章节"
>
  <section
    id="intro"
    class="portal-scene portal-intro is-visible"
    aria-labelledby="intro-title"
    data-scene="01"
  >
    <div class="portal-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-hero-grid">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow"><span></span> 为每一位热爱探索的特斯拉车主</p>
        <h1 id="intro-title">每一次出发，<br />都<span class="portal-accent">值得读懂。</span></h1>
        <p class="portal-lead">车里看到此刻，特友会帮你看见更多。<br />把行程、能耗、电池与充电，连成属于你的用车故事。</p>
        <div class="portal-actions">
          <a
            class="portal-button"
            href={if @registration_policy.allow_registration, do: "/register", else: "#join"}
          >
            加入内测 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="portal-text-link" href="#journeys">探索特友会 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-hero-notes"><span>你的车辆 · 你的数据</span><span>手机 / 电脑 / 车机</span></div>
      </div>
      <TeslaMateWeb.PortalPreview.preview
        page="home"
        title="首页总览"
        class="portal-hero-demo"
      />
    </div>
    <a class="portal-scroll-cue" href="#journeys">
      <span class="portal-scroll-line"></span>向下探索 <span>01 / 05</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section
    id="journeys"
    class="portal-scene portal-journeys"
    aria-labelledby="journeys-title"
    data-scene="02"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-split">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">01 / 让旅程留下更多线索</p>
        <h2 id="journeys-title">走过的路，<br />不止一条<span class="portal-accent">轨迹。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">回看一次通勤，或一段远行。把路线、海拔与能耗放在一起，了解每段路的变化。</p>
        <div class="portal-feature-list">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <p><strong>行程回放</strong>路线、时间、距离与净耗电量，一次看清。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <p><strong>读懂能耗</strong>Wh/km 与 kWh 同时呈现，明确标注电池读数计算或估算来源。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <p><strong>熟悉的地图</strong>支持高德地图与深浅模式，地理围栏为常去地点设置范围。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-journey-examples">
        <div class="portal-preview-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="行程界面示例">
          <button
            id="portal-trip-tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-selected="true"
            aria-controls="portal-trip-example"
          >
            <i class="mdi mdi-map-marker-path" aria-hidden="true"></i> 轨迹详情
          </button>
          <button
            id="portal-trips-tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-selected="false"
            aria-controls="portal-trips-example"
            tabindex="-1"
          >
            <i class="mdi mdi-format-list-bulleted" aria-hidden="true"></i> 行程列表
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="portal-trip-example" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="portal-trip-tab">
          <TeslaMateWeb.PortalPreview.preview
            page="trip"
            title="行程详情 · 查看轨迹"
            class="portal-ui-demo--trip"
          />
        </div>
        <div id="portal-trips-example" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="portal-trips-tab" hidden>
          <TeslaMateWeb.PortalPreview.preview page="trips" title="行程轨迹" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="energy"
    class="portal-scene portal-energy"
    aria-labelledby="energy-title"
    data-scene="03"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-split portal-split-reverse">
      <TeslaMateWeb.PortalPreview.preview page="charging" title="充电记录" class="" />
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">02 / 从一度电，到每一次补能</p>
        <h2 id="energy-title">每一度电，<br />都有<span class="portal-accent">来龙去脉。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">把零散的充电记录，变成清晰的用车账本。看电池状态，也看真正花了多少。</p>
        <div class="portal-feature-list">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <p><strong>电池与温度</strong>汇集可用电池数据与温度读数，高级指标按需展开。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <p><strong>充电费用可补录</strong>官方与第三方充电站的费用，都能手动补充或修改。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <p><strong>数据有依据</strong>有有效电池读数时优先使用，缺失时明确标注估算，不混淆数据来源。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="portal-fine-print">可用指标受车型、固件、授权及实际采集情况影响。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="experience"
    class="portal-scene portal-experience"
    aria-labelledby="experience-title"
    data-scene="04"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner">
      <div class="portal-copy portal-centered">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">03 / 你的视角，你的掌控</p>
        <h2 id="experience-title">随处看得清，<br />数据<span class="portal-accent">有边界。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">电脑上深入分析，手机上随时回顾，车机上查看行车数据。<br />界面随屏幕与明暗环境而变，车辆权限始终跟随账号。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-capabilities">
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">01</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-gauge"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>专注行车的视图</h3>
          <p>海拔、温度等信息集中展示，刷新间隔可调，默认每 5 秒刷新。请在安全停车时操作。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">02</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-weather-night"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>从白天到夜晚</h3>
          <p>首次打开跟随系统颜色模式，支持手动切换。电脑、手机与车机自适应布局。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">03</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-shield-account-outline"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>账号各有边界</h3>
          <p>普通用户仅能访问自己的车辆。支持两步验证、设备会话管理与远程退出。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">04</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-cloud-key-outline"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>由你授权连接</h3>
          <p>通过 Tesla 官方授权绑定车辆，支持 Fleet Telemetry 接入。所需配置及可用数据在连接页说明。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-experience-footer">
        <span>为中文使用习惯设计</span><span>北京时间</span><span>深色 / 浅色</span><span>跨设备体验</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="join" class="portal-scene portal-join" aria-labelledby="join-title" data-scene="05">
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-join-grid">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow"><span></span> 特友会 · 正在内测</p>
        <h2 id="join-title">下一段故事，<br />从<span class="portal-accent">你出发。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">把那些一闪而过的数据，<br />变成更了解爱车的日常。</p>
        <div class="portal-join-status">
          <%= cond do %>
            <% not @registration_policy.allow_registration -> %>
              <p>当前暂未开放新账号注册，请联系管理员了解内测安排。已有账号可直接登录。</p>
            <% @registration_policy.require_invitation -> %>
              <p>当前为邀请内测。请先向管理员获取邀请码，再创建你的账号。</p>
            <% true -> %>
              <p>当前已开放注册。创建账号后，在控制台连接自己的 Tesla 车辆。</p>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-actions">
          <a :if={@registration_policy.allow_registration} class="portal-button" href="/register">
            注册特友会 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class={
              if @registration_policy.allow_registration,
                do: "portal-text-link",
                else: "portal-button"
            }
            href="/sign_in"
          >
            登录已有账号 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-faq">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">开始之前，你可能想知道</p>
        <details open>
          <summary>加入后，如何看到自己的车辆？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>注册后进入控制台，在「Tesla 连接」完成授权。账号不会自动获得其他用户的车辆数据；已有采集车辆也可由管理员提供车辆认领码。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>邀请码和车辆认领码一样吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>不一样。邀请码仅用于创建账号，一次有效；车辆认领码用于绑定已有车辆，两者不能互换。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>所有电池指标都能看到吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>具体取决于车型、车辆固件、接口授权和采集情况。系统会区分实际读数、计算值与估算，不会把未上报的数据当作实测数据。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>这里展示的是真实车主数据吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>不是。示例复用控制台的实际页面和组件，车辆、地点、数值与图表全部使用独立的虚拟数据，不读取或展示数据库中的车辆记录。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      <footer class="portal-footer">
        <a href="#intro" class="portal-brand">
          <span class="portal-mark" aria-hidden="true">t<span>+</span></span><strong>特友会</strong>
        </a>
        <p>独立车辆数据项目，非 Tesla 官方产品。<br />基于 TeslaMate 开源项目构建。</p>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="portal-theme"
          data-theme-toggle
          aria-label="切换深浅模式"
          aria-pressed="false"
        >
          切换明暗
        </button>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/kafuunochino/teslamate"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          开源项目 ↗
        </a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<nav class="portal-chapters" aria-label="产品介绍章节">
  <a href="#intro" aria-label="概览" aria-current="location"><span>概览</span></a><a
    href="#journeys"
    aria-label="行程"
  ><span>行程</span></a><a href="#energy" aria-label="能量"><span>能量</span></a><a
    href="#experience"
    aria-label="体验"
  ><span>体验</span></a><a href="#join" aria-label="加入"><span>加入</span></a>
</nav>
<div class="portal-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

<dialog
  id="portal-preview-dialog"
  class="portal-preview-dialog"
  aria-labelledby="portal-preview-title"
>
  <header>
    <div>
      <h2 id="portal-preview-title">控制台界面</h2>
      <p>实际界面 · 虚拟数据演示 · 仅供浏览</p>
    </div>
    <div class="portal-preview-actions">
      <button
        type="button"
        data-theme-toggle
        aria-label="切换示例深浅模式"
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <i class="mdi mdi-theme-light-dark" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-preview-close aria-label="关闭界面示例" autofocus>
        <i class="mdi mdi-close" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="portal-preview-expanded"></div>
</dialog>
